{"id":"npc:%E8%89%BE%E4%B8%9D%E5%A1%94%E6%8B%89","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"赫曼收养的孩子，称呼对方“艾伦”。在修道院中听阿尔图罗讲故事，后被费德里科带回住所休息并请求他帮忙寻找母亲，最后为花匠盖上新得的毯子。事件结束后前往拉特兰生活。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情HE-1_我有一个荣美家乡、HE-2_生命运河等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_929_1-1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_929_1-1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_929_1-1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_beg","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":354,"line":355,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"大哥哥，看起来好凶……"},{"commandIndex":358,"line":359,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"妈妈说过，不可以回答不知道名字的陌生人的问题……"},{"commandIndex":422,"line":423,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"哇！"}]},{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_beg","lineCount":19,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":118,"line":119,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"（好可怜……）"},{"commandIndex":377,"line":378,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"那妈妈……妈妈没有东西吃，一直都很难受……？"},{"commandIndex":549,"line":550,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"晚、晚安……！"}]},{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_end","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":228,"line":229,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"（翻身）"},{"commandIndex":248,"line":249,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"妈妈……"}]},{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_st02","lineCount":5,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":270,"line":271,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"艾伦，艾伦！醒一醒，艾伦——"},{"commandIndex":291,"line":292,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"破一点也没关系呀，我们是好孩子，要体谅妈妈啦，妈妈自己的衣服都破破的……"},{"commandIndex":296,"line":297,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"今天也能和费德里科哥哥一起玩吗……？"}]},{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_08_end","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":387,"line":388,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"阿尔图罗姐姐……？"},{"commandIndex":398,"line":399,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"嘘，这个叔叔睡着啦，我们不要吵醒他……"},{"commandIndex":427,"line":428,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"嗯，希望叔叔睡醒之后，能继续种出好多好多好看的花……"}]},{"story":"activities/act26side/level_act26side_st03","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":250,"line":251,"speaker":"艾丝塔拉","text":"嗯，妈妈昨晚给我们带了礼物，我们借给一个睡着的叔叔了……"}]}]}